doi: "10.5281/zenodo.21521522"
abstract: >-
  Deterministic event-driven simulator, experiment scripts, frozen results,
  supplementary material, and anonymized trace evidence supporting the accepted
  article on persistence-aware admission control for denial-of-service-resilient
  Bluetooth Low Energy resolvable private address resolution. The headline
  evidence is simulation-based; no measured power or deployed production
  firmware result is claimed.
